    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d496-a1">

                <pb facs="0460" n="378" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg378"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Adjutant General to the
                            Commanding General</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >War Department</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-12-18"><hi rendition="#italic">December 18,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>State Department reports 200 revolutionists in vicinity Ojinaga pursued by
                    Mexican troops. It is thought they may attempt to cross border near Presidio,
                    Tex. Secretary War directs you proceed in this case under your previous
                    instructions in case after investigation you deem any action necessary.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ainsworth.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
